    "text": "<p>The wave function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>&#936;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#936;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msup></math></p><p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>, radial node is formed. Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;in terms of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>"
