  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The wave function (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#936;</mi></math>) of 2s is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#936;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msup></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>, radial node is formed.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#936;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo></math>= Probability density of finding an electron</p><p>At node,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#936;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math>Probability of finding an electron is zero at the node)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#936;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">